  "referenceNumber": "VEN0028",
  "remarks": "\nNational Assembly Deputy (2021-2026) and Vice President of the National Assembly’s People’s Power and Media Commission. Former member of the illegitimate National Constituent Assembly since August 2017, and former First Vice President since October 2018. Her actions as part of the National Constituent Assembly (ANC) including signing the decree that stripped the immunity of the president of the National Assembly (AN) and the interim-president of Venezuela, Juan Guaido, have undermined democracy and rule of law in Venezuela.  \n",
